---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' EXPECT (preproc): not like glibc, a directive that is not in C99 is a ValueError, on every machine
' title ValueError ValueError ValueError UTC +0000
!r = []
!for f in ['%Q', '%', '%-d']:
!    try:
!        time.strftime(f, time.gmtime(0))
!    except ValueError:
!        r.append('ValueError')
title !{' '.join(r)} !{time.strftime('%Z')} !{time.strftime('%z')}
@enduml
